        { "id": "b", "text": "x = 13" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "x = -7" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "x = -13" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "6x - 3 = 5x + 10. x = 13. Check: 3(25) = 75 and 5(15) = 75."
